s": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c8ab167c/tourist-visa-agency", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/e089b3bb-5a99-41bc-8881-40980028b748.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "签证旅行规划Skills", "ownerName": "user_c8ab167c", "score": 5544.933078393881, "slug": "tourist-visa-agency", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781583005613, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780801800371, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_15292d5a/yjkj-cn-duplicate-remover", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "cn-duplicate-remover", "ownerName": "user_15292d5a", "score": 3341.013824884793, "slug": "yjkj-cn-duplicate-remover", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781583005273, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780790586322, "description": "AI-powered orchid growth-status detection from HD images (including roots visible through transparent pots) via orchid cameras or smartphones. Measures new-shoot count, flower-spike length, and root color/condition (white = healthy, brown = aged, black = rotten) to deliver a holistic vitality assessment (vigorous / normal / weak) plus care guidance such as 'three new shoots, healthy roots, increase phosphorus-potassium to promote spike growth'. Helps orchid hobbyists pinpoint repotting and feeding timing. Scenarios: home orchid care, orchid greenhouses, horticulture studios. | 通过兰花栽培专用摄像头或手机拍摄的高清图像（包括透明兰盆内的根系），利用AI视觉分析技术检测兰花新芽萌发数量、花梗（花箭）生长长度以及根系颜色（白色健康、褐色老化、黑色腐烂），综合输出兰花的生长状态评估（旺盛/正常/衰弱）及养护建议（如\\\"新芽萌发3个，根系健康，可适当增加磷钾肥促进花梗生长\\\"）。有助于兰花爱好者精准掌握植株生长节奏，及时调整水肥管理。应用场景：兰花家庭养护、兰花大棚、兰花园艺工作室。", "description_zh": "AI-powered orchid growth-status detection from HD images (including roots visible through transparent pots) via orchid cameras or smartphones. Measures new-shoot count, flower-spike length, and root color/condition (white = healthy, brown = aged, black = rotten) to deliver a holistic vitality assessment (vigorous / normal / weak) plus care guidance such as 'three new shoots, healthy roots, increase phosphorus-potassium to promote spike growth'. Helps orchid hobbyists pinpoint repotting and feeding timing. Scenarios: home orchid care, orchid greenhouses, horticulture studios. | 通过兰花栽培专用摄像头或手机拍摄的高清图像（包括透明兰盆内的根系），利用AI视觉分析技术检测兰花新芽萌发数量、花梗（花箭）生长长度以及根系颜色（白色健康、褐色老化、黑色腐烂），综合输出兰花的生长状态评估（旺盛/正常/衰弱）及养护建议（如\\\"新芽萌发3个，根系健康，可适当增加磷钾肥促进花梗生长\\\"）。有助于兰花爱好者精准掌握植株生长节奏，及时调整水肥管理。应用场景：兰花家庭养护、兰花大棚、兰花园艺工作室。", "downloads": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_bb47e3e3/orchid-growth-status-detection-analysis", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "Orchid Growth Status Detection (Shoots / Spike / Roots) | 兰花新芽/花梗/根系状态识别", "ownerName": "user_bb47e3e3", "score": 5653.021442495126, "slug": "orchid-growth-status-detection-analysis", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1781583005053, "upstream_owner_login": null, "upstream_url": null, "verified": false, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "claim_state": "unclaimed", "claimable": false, "claimed_user_handle": null, "created_at": 1780801669011, "description": "", "description_zh": "", "downloads": 29, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_15292d5a/yjkj-cn-social-reply", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "last_synced_at": null, "name": "cn-social-reply", "ownerName": "user_15292d5a", "score": 4178.674351585014, "slug": "yjkj-cn